pointless (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of pointless keyboard-driven cursor utility
  * Support for multiple grid types (homogeneous, QWERTY, arrow, Vim)
  * Configurable modifier keys and visual appearance
  * Optional computer vision features with OpenCV integration
  * Comprehensive documentation and man pages
  * Integration tests and CI/CD pipeline

